#### 4. Mystery Guest *(Smell 2)*

**Test:** `ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly` (line 140)
**Risk:** Depends on an external file at a hard-coded absolute Windows path. The test will fail on any machine without that file, on Linux CI, or if the CSV content changes outside the test's control.

```csharp
// ❌ External file dependency
var orders = processor.ImportOrders(
    File.ReadAllText(@"C:\TestData\orders.csv"));
```

**Fix — inline the test data:**

```csharp
[TestMethod]
public void ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly()
{
    var processor = new OrderProcessor(_db, _email, _inventory);
    const string csv =
        "SKU,Qty\n" +
        "SKU-1,2\nSKU-2,1\nSKU-3,4\nSKU-4,1\nSKU-5,3\n";

    var orders = processor.ImportOrders(csv);

    Assert.AreEqual(5, orders.Count);
}
```

